<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-6018] Update gRPC version from 1.51.0 to 1.55.1 for successful Apache Zeppelin build on s390x architecture </title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-6018</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This update modifies the grpc-java dependency version from 1.51.0 to 1.55.1. This change ensures compatibility and resolves build issues encountered on the s390x architecture. After implementing this change, the Apache Zeppelin package now builds successfully on the s390x architecture.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment>&lt;p&gt;s390x&lt;/p&gt;</environment>
